OL,3,GNEWSACleverly to run as Tory London    
OL,4,Amayor candidate                        
OL,6,FHe said London's "best days are ahead  
OL,7,Fif we make a change at the forthcoming 
OL,8,Felection". The next mayoral election   
OL,9,Fwill be in May 2028.                   
